    "created_at": "2020-06-24T20:06:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-24T20:08:46Z",
    "body": "In addition to what Dario mentioned, `nvm` is very slow when fetching the Node version. Considerably slower than calling Node directly:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"600\" alt=\"CleanShot 2020-06-24 at 16 03 18@2x\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4658208/85622045-3dd2c800-b634-11ea-8936-7c816134134d.png\">\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, this would delay the render of the prompt as a whole, so I would rather we avoid calling `nvm` altogether.",
